[1.953448, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1mCONSTRAINTS (1 active)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[33mADR-1321\u001b[0m  An error names the command that fixes it\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mSPECIFICATIONS (1)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[33mSPEC-a169\u001b[0m  What depot is, and what it refuses to be\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mTASKS (2)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[33mTASK-0f88\u001b[0m  \u001b[34m[open]\u001b[0m deploy refuses an environment it does not know\r\n  \u001b[33mTASK-5559\u001b[0m  \u001b[34m[open]\u001b[0m The refusal lists the environments depot knows\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m> ank claim TASK-0f88 to start\u001b[0m\r\n"]
