[6.094611, "o", "\u001b[33mTASK-0f88\u001b[0m  \u001b[34m[open]\u001b[0m deploy refuses an environment it does not know\r\n├── \u001b[33mTASK-5559\u001b[0m  \u001b[34m[open]\u001b[0m The refusal lists the environments depot knows\r\n│   └── \u001b[33mTASK-e2aa\u001b[0m  \u001b[34m[open]\u001b[0m The refusal is tested through the binary\r\n└── \u001b[33mTASK-ceac\u001b[0m  \u001b[34m[open]\u001b[0m depot.toml is validated before the first request\r\n\r\n4 task(s), 1 root(s) — indented under what blocks them\r\n"]
